	measure 'Days past due (oldest)' = ```
			
			VAR AsOfDate = MAX( DimDate[Date] )                          
			VAR OverdueOpenInvoices =
			    FILTER(
			        CALCULATETABLE(
			            FactInvoices,
			            REMOVEFILTERS( DimDate ),                        
			            FactInvoices[DueDate] < AsOfDate                 
			        ),
			        [Open AR] > 0                                        
			    )
			VAR OldestDueDate =
			    MINX( OverdueOpenInvoices, FactInvoices[DueDate] )
			RETURN
			    IF(
			        NOT ISBLANK( OldestDueDate ),                        
			        INT( AsOfDate - OldestDueDate )
			    )
			```
		displayFolder: 5. Receivables
		lineageTag: 81e4200c-0d53-4f58-a4c8-2c6f8ca9131b

